{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "\u8a66\u3055\u308c\u308b\u5927\u5730 Challenging Land",
    "steam_appid": 3866730,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010The land is merciless\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land is testing you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summoned by a mysterious force, you proceed to meet the harsh demands of the land!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Base system\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has a JRPG atmosphere, with gathering and simple combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a simulation in genre, although it has various elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can get placements in the field, set them up in unique rooms, collect them, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of the collection can be Idle, and each parameter, such as the number of items acquired and the speed of collection, is affected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also grow your parameters along the way, so train and get over it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Objects gradually increasing\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of objects to be placed will gradually increase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, there are objects for collecting, but there are also objects for processing and creating by combining materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many of them are even unique with their own functions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Convenient warp function\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a convenient feature that allows you to memorize a favorite location on the land and fly to it at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Profit from playing time\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The use of meals allows for a special time to elapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the special time reaches its maximum value, the special time is reset and benefits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are items that increase this profit itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Localization\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developers used their own localization methods to prioritize the pace of development.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010The land is merciless\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land is testing you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summoned by a mysterious force, you proceed to meet the harsh demands of the land!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Base system\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has a JRPG atmosphere, with gathering and simple combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a simulation in genre, although it has various elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can get placements in the field, set them up in unique rooms, collect them, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of the collection can be Idle, and each parameter, such as the number of items acquired and the speed of collection, is affected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also grow your parameters along the way, so train and get over it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Objects gradually increasing\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of objects to be placed will gradually increase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, there are objects for collecting, but there are also objects for processing and creating by combining materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many of them are even unique with their own functions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Convenient warp function\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a convenient feature that allows you to memorize a favorite location on the land and fly to it at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Profit from playing time\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The use of meals allows for a special time to elapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the special time reaches its maximum value, the special time is reset and benefits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are items that increase this profit itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Localization\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developers used their own localization methods to prioritize the pace of development.</p>",
